!app/src/main/assets/midu/README.md

# 规则种子是纯文本，随工程入库；上游产物 / 用户文件不入库
!app/src/main/assets/rules/vendor_unified_rule.txt
local_rules/upstream_unified_rule.txt
local_rules/upstream_rule_patch.txt
local_rules/user_rules.txt.bak
*.pcm
*.log

# 构建产物（APK 大件不入库，仅供本机自用）
dist/
*.apk
